number\\\":2,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Client Data in AI Training Pipelines\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Employees pasting client contracts, PII, and financial data into AI tools without realizing that data may be retained and used for model training. One paste can become a breach across thousands of future users.\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Has your team ever pasted client or employee data into an AI tool?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"severity\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"number\\\":3,\\\"title\\\":\\\"No AI Acceptable Use Policy\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Without a policy, you have no baseline, no enforcement mechanism, and no legal protection when something goes wrong. Your cyber insurer will ask. Your enterprise clients will ask. You need an answer.\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Do you have a written AI Acceptable Use Policy signed by your employees?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"severity\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"number\\\":4,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Compliance Exposure (HIPAA, GDPR, SOC 2)\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"HIPAA requires a BAA for any vendor handling PHI — most AI providers won't sign one. GDPR requires documented lawful basis for processing in AI systems. SOC 2 auditors are increasingly asking about AI controls.\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Have you formally mapped your AI stack against your compliance obligations?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L12\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"severity\\\":\\\"medium\\\",\\\"number\\\":5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Unchecked AI Vendor \\u0026 Third-Party Risk\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Every AI vendor is a potential supply chain risk. When was the last time you reviewed their security posture, data retention terms, incident response SLA, or sub-processor list?\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"When did you last review the security documentation for your AI vendors?\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"classNa