ance\"}],\"$L14\"]}],\"$L15\"]}]]}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white py-20 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-3\",\"children\":\"// FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-3xl font-bold\",\"children\":\"Common Questions\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"How long does the audit take?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"How long does the audit take?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"5–7 business days from intake completion, depending on tier. Enterprise engagements are 7 business days.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Do I need technical staff for this?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Do I need technical staff for this?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"No. The intake process is designed for non-technical business owners and operations managers. You describe what you're using and how — I do the technical analysis.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What do I do with the report?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"What do I do with the report?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The report gives you a prioritized action list with specific next steps for each finding. If you need help implementing the recommendations, that's a separate engagement we can discuss.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Is my data safe during the audit?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Is my data safe during the audit?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. All data is stored encrypted, retained for 90 days post-engagement, and covered under a data processing agreement provided at intake. I don't share client data with any third party.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Can this help with HIPAA or SOC 2 compliance?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Can this help with HIPAA or SOC 2 compliance?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. Compliance gap analysis against HIPAA, SOC 2, and GDPR is included in every tier. The report documents where your AI stack creates compliance exposure and what controls would address it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What's the difference between an audit report and a penetration test?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-divider p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"What's the difference between an audit report and a penetration test?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A penetration test looks for technical exploits in your systems. An AI security audit assesses your governance, data handling practices, policy posture, and vendor risk — the human and process layer that pen tests typically miss.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"headline\":\"Book Your Free 20-Minute AI Risk Discovery Call\",\"subhead\":\"Find out exactly where your AI stack is exposed. No commitment required. Proposal delivered within 2 hours of the call.\",\"primaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"Book a Free Discovery Call\",\"href\":\"https://calendly.com\"},\"secondaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"Download Free Risk Overview\",\"href\":\"/free-risk-overview\"}}]\nf:[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L18\",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"promise\":\"$@1a\"}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"children\":\"$L1c\"}],null],[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1e\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$L1f\"}]}]}]]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Assess whether AI-specific policies exist, are current, and are actually enforced.\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"div\",\"06\",{\"className\":\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal/40 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-teal-lt text-xs font-bold mb-2 opacity-60\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-white text-sm font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Compliance Alignment\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Map AI tool usage against applicable regulatory requirements.\"}]]}]\n1c:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n18:null\n20:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n1a:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AI Security Audit Service | $499–$2,499 | AITrustAudit.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Comprehensive AI security audit reports covering Shadow AI, data handling, vendor risk, and compliance. Delivered in 5 business days. No retainer required.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://www.aitrust